PS D:\PerformanceTest\src&gt; ls


    Directory: D:\PerformanceTest\src


Mode                 LastWriteTime         Length Name
----                 -------------         ------ ----
-a----         5/28/2024   1:19 AM            472 Main.java
-a----         5/28/2024   1:14 AM            276 SimpleTask.java
